OL,3,AVenezuela signs military deal with US  
OL,4,Aless than a year after Maduro's removal
OL,6,FFew details about the deal have been   
OL,7,Freleased so far but Hegseth said that  
OL,8,FVenezuela had "gone from our most      
OL,9,Faggressive regional threat to a        
OL,10,Fcompliant security partner" in less    
OL,11,Fthan 12 months.                        
OL,13,FInterim President Rodriguez said the   
OL,14,Fdeal would help confront "common       
OL,15,Fthreats".                              
